{"3898860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roommates, Romance, and Ringing Hearts", "steam_appid": 3898860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4234230, 4251950, 4252000, 4251990, 4251970, 4251980, 4251960], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience romance that makes your heart flutter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TV Asahi and Aiming join forces to bring you a true romance simulation that could change your life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romance so real it will awaken your heart to love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/c770bf1edd67fe7f1d942f269b196872.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/c770bf1edd67fe7f1d942f269b196872.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Story&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve just moved to the city, excited to begin your new college life. But after an unexpected mishap leaves you without a place to stay, you end up moving into a shared house. There, a new chapter begins as you start life under the same roof with five unique and captivating heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change, you’ll spend a year together with them, sharing moments like picking out swimsuits for summer break, joining a Halloween party, celebrating Christmas, and many more memorable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision shapes your relationships and determines the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your choices truly reach her heart and stir her emotions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your choices resonate deeply enough to touch their hearts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>＜Heroines＞</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>① Nao / Cast: Nao Hanashiro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your childhood friend who knows you better than anyone, a little jealous but always by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/ecf6769b39c88f5c49f3ffcdada3f63c.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/ecf6769b39c88f5c49f3ffcdada3f63c.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>② Nagi / Cast: Non Nagisa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aspiring idol trainee. She’s not great at dancing but works hard every day. Though she often acts distant, she’s truly a kind and caring girl inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/7c5f69ab3b41341f0dcf264b6ab86a9f.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/7c5f69ab3b41341f0dcf264b6ab86a9f.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>③ Anon / Cast: Anon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reliable senior at your part-time job. With the gentle warmth of someone older, she has a way of soothing your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/9637f6cbb3ed015f1864d945537da878.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/9637f6cbb3ed015f1864d945537da878.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>④ Ruka / Cast: Ruka Kitano</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nationally beloved idol and the younger sister of your close friend. She’s innocent, playful, and so irresistibly cute that you can’t help but care for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/e38dca6e9bc5b7e5631a22747b699dda.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/e38dca6e9bc5b7e5631a22747b699dda.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⑤ Mirei / Cast: Mirei Kamiyama</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regular customer at your part-time job. An older woman with an air of mystery and irresistible allure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/71d82e1610f28036e7fd9575ec471ba2.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/71d82e1610f28036e7fd9575ec471ba2.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing together the expertise of a leading TV network known for hit dramas and variety shows, and a game studio that has delivered smiles to players around the world, this project combines live-action storytelling with a romance simulation game to create an experience that makes you feel like the star of a romantic comedy. Enjoy a variety of captivating situations and heartfelt stories brought to life through stunning, cinematic visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#RRRHearts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#FMV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#DatingSim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience romance that makes your heart flutter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TV Asahi and Aiming join forces to bring you a true romance simulation that could change your life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romance so real it will awaken your heart to love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/c770bf1edd67fe7f1d942f269b196872.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/c770bf1edd67fe7f1d942f269b196872.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Story&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve just moved to the city, excited to begin your new college life. But after an unexpected mishap leaves you without a place to stay, you end up moving into a shared house. There, a new chapter begins as you start life under the same roof with five unique and captivating heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change, you’ll spend a year together with them, sharing moments like picking out swimsuits for summer break, joining a Halloween party, celebrating Christmas, and many more memorable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision shapes your relationships and determines the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your choices truly reach her heart and stir her emotions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your choices resonate deeply enough to touch their hearts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>＜Heroines＞</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>① Nao / Cast: Nao Hanashiro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your childhood friend who knows you better than anyone, a little jealous but always by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/ecf6769b39c88f5c49f3ffcdada3f63c.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/ecf6769b39c88f5c49f3ffcdada3f63c.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>② Nagi / Cast: Non Nagisa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An aspiring idol trainee. She’s not great at dancing but works hard every day. Though she often acts distant, she’s truly a kind and caring girl inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/7c5f69ab3b41341f0dcf264b6ab86a9f.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/7c5f69ab3b41341f0dcf264b6ab86a9f.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>③ Anon / Cast: Anon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reliable senior at your part-time job. With the gentle warmth of someone older, she has a way of soothing your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/9637f6cbb3ed015f1864d945537da878.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/9637f6cbb3ed015f1864d945537da878.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>④ Ruka / Cast: Ruka Kitano</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nationally beloved idol and the younger sister of your close friend. She’s innocent, playful, and so irresistibly cute that you can’t help but care for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/e38dca6e9bc5b7e5631a22747b699dda.poster.avif?t=1777254582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898860/extras/e38dca6e9bc5b7e5631a22747b699dda.webm?t=1777254582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⑤ Mirei / Cast: Mirei Kamiyama</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regular customer at your part-time job. An older woman with an air of mystery and irresistible allure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\"